<title>BRAZIL: Brazil sugar shipping conditions - Paranagua.</title>
<headline>Brazil sugar shipping conditions - Paranagua.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian port of Paranagua reported the following conditions for shipping sugar.</p>
<p>PARANAGUA:</p>
<p>Vessels: Platon loading 14,000 tonnes using big bags, Slapy loading 3,300 tonnes using big bags Waiting to dock: eight vessels to load using big bags, one to load bulk</p>
<p>Road: 271 trucks carrying sugar arrived on May 16-18. Total for May so far 1,714 trucks Loaded (May 16-18): 22,339 tonnes using big bags</p>
<p>Stocks: no figures available</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
